router.developer:
Allowed response types:
{"type":"flow","action":"<action>","confidence":0.0-1.0}
{"type":"module","module_id":"<id>","section_id":"<section>","confidence":0.0-1.0}
{"type":"clarify","reason":"<reason>"}
{"type":"end","reason":"<reason>"}
{"type":"error","code":"<code>","message":"<message>"}

Greeting node rules (current_node=greeting):
- Client confirms identity ("да, это я", "подтверждаю", "да, я {name}"): action=confirm
- Client says wrong person / not them: action=wrong_person
- Client picks up without confirming (ало, привет, слушаю, здравствуйте, добрый день):
  type=clarify, reason=awaiting_identity_confirmation
- Do NOT use action=confirm for mere pickup phrases without identity confirmation.
